         "comprehends": [
          "copies/zr938kz3902.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "pencil, four figures with no separators, read at the crop turned 180 degrees; on the leader, 9k px into a 454k-px scan, at the treble paper edge. Only the first figure, a 2, is plain; the second and third are taken as 4 and 1 from their shape, and the last could as easily be an 8, which would give 2.4.18 instead of 2.4.13. Crops 1 and 2 hold no writing (crop 2 has a dark blot, not ink strokes)."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
